OL,3,GNEWSACreative space plan for closed
OL,4,Atourist attraction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA children's activity centre at a
OL,7,Fclosed tourist attraction could become
OL,8,Fa space for artists if plans are
OL,9,Fapproved.
OL,11,FAn application to turn the former
OL,12,FPlaybarn building at aMaizin! Adventure
OL,13,FPark, which closed in 2025, into a
OL,14,F"collective creative hub" has been
OL,15,Fsubmitted to Jersey's planning
OL,16,Fdepartment.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
