OL,3,GNEWSACreative space plan for closed
OL,4,Atourist attraction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe building at La Hougue Farm, St
OL,7,FPeter, would be called Under One Roof
OL,8,Fand be a space for artists, sculptors
OL,9,Fand other members of the creative
OL,10,Fcommunity to work, the application
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FJersey Business, a company which
OL,14,Fsupports and offers advice to
OL,15,Fbusinesses, said it backed the plans as
OL,16,Fit would help develop the island's
OL,17,F"need to grow a more balanced,
OL,18,Fresilient and visible non-financial
OL,19,Feconomy".
